TITLE:: ToggleSwitch
summary:: A nice little Toggle switch
categories:: Undocumented classes
related:: Classes/SomeRelatedClass, Reference/SomeRelatedStuff, etc.

DESCRIPTION::
A horizontal or vertical toggle switch with a label


CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
create a new ToggleSwitch.

ARGUMENT:: parent
A parent view.

ARGUMENT:: bounds
A Rect. if width>height, a horizontal switch, otherwise vertical.

ARGUMENT:: label
A label text. For vertical swiches omit or make very short.

ARGUMENT:: toggleWidth
The size of the toggle widget.

returns:: a new ToggleSwitch



EXAMPLES::

code::

(
FlowView.new.flow{|w|
	w.parent.background=Color.white;
	w.startRow;
	w.startRow;
	t=ToggleSwitch(w, Rect(0,0,150,18),"Toggle Me").action_({|v| v.value.postln});
		w.startRow;
	r=ToggleSwitch(w, Rect(0,0,18,60),"ff").action_({|v| v.value.postln});


}
)


t.valueAction=1


t.onColor_(Color.red(0.8)).refresh

t.offColor_(Color.green(0.8)).refresh

t.valueAction=0
::